OL,5,G0449 Midsummer Dreaming
OL,6,     F6/6. From sunset until sunrise on
OL,7,     Fthe solstice, Verity Sharp
OL,8,     Fpresents a special dream-like
OL,9,     Fnight of radio documentaries from
OL,10,     FRadio 3's archives - accompanied
OL,11,     Fby music for enchantment.
OL,12,G0630 Breakfast
OL,13,     FMark Forrest presents Radio 3's
OL,14,     FBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,15,     Femail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,16,G0900 Sunday Morning
OL,17,     FJoin Sarah Walker for a special
OL,18,     Fedition of the programme, live
OL,19,     Ffrom Glastonbury Abbey, with
OL,20,     Fspecial guests the Ayoub Sisters
OL,21,     Fperforming live.
